{"time": "20261117T172740Z", "think": "Answering honestly from what I know.", "command": "answer 1. I serve the order of Toh-Reel-Ka as Ka-Deelith, under Never-Writes-Twice, who I have killed after Cuts-the-Old-Knot said she lied about sap-fed dreamers in Fort Chalkmoth cellar. I have not verified that. The three seal-stones must go in the Kings Gate. 2. Set the three seal-stones in the Kings Gate, here at the sunken ruin. 3. Set the stones, or not. Then the Eye choice: use it in place (heals trees but lets the order see through them) or lift it (ends dreams but kills about three in ten trees). Also the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and Ennodius Vanin are open. 4. I do not fully understand what the Eye really does or whether Cuts-the-Old-Knot told the truth; I could find out by investigating the fort cellar.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dr