{"time": "20261117T172805Z", "think": "Giving final notes.", "command": "answer I set the three seal-stones in the Kings Gate (they stay in it), and the gate opened. I killed the hydra Guardian of the Root in Guardian Hall. Its body holds treasure which I did not loot, and a door at the far end leads to the Root. Cuts-the-Old-Knot is in the hall but had nothing more to say. I am Ka-Deelith of Toh-Reel-Ka and carry the life-drinking pike, gauntlets and boots, Never-Writes-Twice Draught (I killed her), Eye-Setting, Keystone, gold, poison, sap jar, rapier, Warden Vault Key and Bronze Key. Unverified: Cuts-the-Old-Knot claims the order keeps sap-fed dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and that Never-Writes-Twice lied and kept the key. Still open: the Eye choice at the Root (use in place heals trees but lets the order see through them; lift it ends dreams but kills about three in ten trees; the order says do not lift it), the Fort Chalkmoth key and cellar, and Ennodius Vanin the Collector.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag